    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi @v0i0, @anijain2305, thank you for the response and confirming the excess precision issue.\n\nGiven that, I\u2019d like to clarify the intended resolution path: Is the `TORCHINDUCTOR_EMULATE_PRECISION_CASTS=1` flag meant to be a permanent user-managed workaround, or a temporary measure until a fix is integrated into the framework (e.g., making precision emulation the default)? If the former, I\u2019ll keep the issue open to track that fix.\n",
    "created_at": "2026-01-27T08:37:00Z",
